The key to piloting Choco, Seeker of Paradise is understanding its core engine: Choco turns every evasive Bird attack into library digging and land ramp. While lands enter tapped, Amulet of Vigor and Lotus Cobra turn that ramp into immediate mana, and Scute Swarm triggers exponentially to overwhelm opponents with an aerial and land swarm.
This is a Bracket 3 build running three Game Changers: Rhystic Study, Cyclonic Rift, Teferi's Protection. It contains zero mass land denial and focuses on high-synergy board development, interactive answers, and an inevitable endgame clock.

# Commander and Core Synergy
Choco, Seeker of Paradise :: primary commander driving the deck's core strategy
Scute Swarm :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Lotus Cobra :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Jackdaw Savior :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Bartz and Boko :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage
Empyrean Eagle :: critical engine card maximizing commander synergy and card advantage

# High-Impact Engines and Support
Amulet of Vigor :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Derevi, Empyrial Tactician :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Airborne Aid :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Kindred Discovery :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Heroic Intervention :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion

# Game Changers and Interaction
Rhystic Study :: high-power Game Changer providing irreplaceable tempo, draw, or board control
Cyclonic Rift :: high-power Game Changer providing irreplaceable tempo, draw, or board control
Teferi's Protection :: high-power Game Changer providing irreplaceable tempo, draw, or board control
Swords to Plowshares :: efficient interaction and acceleration keeping the table in check
Path to Exile :: efficient interaction and acceleration keeping the table in check
Counterspell :: efficient interaction and acceleration keeping the table in check
Arcane Signet :: efficient interaction and acceleration keeping the table in check
Sol Ring :: efficient interaction and acceleration keeping the table in check
